export anchor BlockPrintStyle:
    number: 149
    screen: ProjectsDashboard
    name: Block print
    idea: The dashboard is a hand block printed cloth, with an indigo border of repeated motifs, madder red stripes between printed panels, stamped figures with slightly rough edges and progress counted in printed dots.
    base: light
    palette:
        cotton: #f4eee2, the printed field, fields and swatch cards
        unbleached: #e8dcc6, the page behind the cloth
        indigo: #1f3a6b, the border ground, headings, figures, progress dots, the current tab and last week hatching
        indigoWash: #dfe5ef, alternate project rows and the bell
        madder: #9e2f24, stripes, the primary button, overdue, Behind, this week bars and focus
        madderWash: #f3ddd4, the overdue notice
        turmeric: #c99a2e, small motif accents, never text
        ink: #1d1d26, body text
        muted: #544f5f, meta and labels
        leafGreen: #35582a, On track
        ochre: #7a5300, At risk
    type:
        Labels, headings and figures use Futura, Futura PT, Century
        Gothic, URW Gothic, Avenir Next, sans-serif. Text uses Charter,
        Bitstream Charter, Sitka Text, Cambria, Noto Serif, Georgia,
        serif. Greeting 44px with the name in italic indigo, stamped
        figures 60px bold, panel titles 22px tracked 0.06em, row titles
        18px semibold serif, categories 13px caps, body 15 to 16px at
        1.55.
    layout:
        The whole dashboard is one cloth up to 1280px. A 36px border of
        cotton butas and dots on indigo wraps a cotton field printed with
        faint indigo and madder six petal flowers over a fine weave. The
        header has a buta mark with the brand, plain nav with a solid
        indigo current item, a square search, a madder button with a 2px
        indigo offset, a square bell and a round avatar, then a madder
        stripe of cotton diamonds runs edge to edge. The greeting sits
        left with the date in spaced sans, and a madder wash notice with a
        thick left edge names 4 overdue tasks on the right. The four
        totals are one ruled band split by dashed lines, each a large
        stamped figure beside its label. Below, the field splits into two
        panels by a vertical madder stripe, projects on the left as rows
        with alternating indigo wash, the category, title, status and a
        row of ten printed dots where each filled dot is a tenth of the
        work, then percent, tasks and due date. On the right the chart,
        hatched indigo bars last week and solid madder this week with a
        rough edge, two outlined totals, a stripe, then activity led by
        small madder flower stamps. On phones the stripe turns
        horizontal, totals go two by two and rows stack.
    spacing: An 8px unit. A 36px printed border, 28 to 32px inside the field, 14px row padding.
    density: Medium. Panels sit edge to edge like blocks on one cloth, split by stripes rather than gaps.
    corners: Square, only dots and the avatar are round.
    borders: A wide repeat border of indigo butas, 12px madder stripes with cotton diamonds between panels, dashed indigo lines between figures.
    shadows: None, except a 2px indigo offset under the primary button like a misaligned second block.
    icons:
        Stamped shapes passed through a slight roughening filter. Status
        uses a six petal flower for On track, a triangle for At risk and a
        square with an inner square for Behind, beside the word.
    focus: A 3px madder outline offset 2 to 3px.
    tone: Quiet workshop voice, such as one printed dot for every tenth of the work.
